  "summary": "Backstage: Improper access control in backend action invocation",
  "details": "### Impact\n\nAn authenticated user could invoke actions that an operator had excluded through action configuration. Existing action permissions and downstream authorization remain enforced.\n\n### Patches\n\nPatched in `@backstage/backend-defaults` version `0.17.8`\n\n### Workarounds\n\nLimit access to action invocation endpoints to trusted service callers until upgrading.",
